@stellarie/dsh-session-bridge README · Requirements：- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1-rc.3` or `0.2.1-rc.2`, with a profile you can edit.
- Node.js `^22.19.0` or `>=24.0.0`.
- An MCP client that speaks stdio.

@stellarie/dsh-session-bridge README · 1. Install the plugin：```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@stellarie/dsh-session-bridge": "^0.1.0"
  },

The package ships a `cordis.patch.yml`. It inserts the plugin row for you. Restart the app.
The log shows `session-bridge: serving http://127.0.0.1:…/session-bridge`.

@stellarie/dsh-session-bridge README · Tools：A typical round trip:

```text
dsh_open_session { cwd: "C:/repo", preset: "my-preset" }  → { sessionId, reused, workspaceId, effort }
dsh_send         { sessionId, text: "Fix the failing test" } → { accepted, afterSeq: 41 }
dsh_wait         { sessionId, afterSeq: 41 }               → { ended: true, lastSeq: 58 }
dsh_read         { sessionId, afterSeq: 41 }               → { messages: [ … ] }

@stellarie/dsh-session-bridge README · 环境要求：- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1-rc.3` 或 `0.2.1-rc.2`，并且你可以编辑它的配置档（profile）。
- Node.js `^22.19.0` 或 `>=24.0.0`。
- 一个支持 stdio 的 MCP 客户端。

@stellarie/dsh-session-bridge README · 工具：```text
dsh_open_session { cwd: "C:/repo", preset: "my-preset" }  → { sessionId, reused, workspaceId, effort }
dsh_send         { sessionId, text: "Fix the failing test" } → { accepted, afterSeq: 41 }
dsh_wait         { sessionId, afterSeq: 41 }               → { ended: true, lastSeq: 58 }
dsh_read         { sessionId, afterSeq: 41 }               → { messages: [ … ] }

> `dsh_open_session` 的 `preset` 默认值是 `yuu`，那是作者自己的预设。请传入你自己的预设 id。
> 参见 [BACKLOG 1](docs/BACKLOG.md)。
